{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the local village to sniff out mischievous doggos and elusive items in this cozy, charming, and hand-drawn hidden object adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Labby and meet Rolo, Weenie, Biff, and Shep. Solve their troubles, earn their trust, and chase your dream of making a video game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363810/extras/e0e9dbd84b8319dc5be08c07d9d6555d.avif?t=1772689482\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 15 hand-drawn levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >500+ dogs and items to find! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the dog whistle to startle mischievous mutts when you get stuck. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy cozy village sounds and watch levels animate to the music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363810/extras/fb9dcfd9cba121507c721bbcf62a7af5.poster.avif?t=1772689482\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363810/extras/fb9dcfd9cba121507c721bbcf62a7af5.webm?t=1772689482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363810/extras/fb9dcfd9cba121507c721bbcf62a7af5.mp4?t=1772689482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363810/extras/91d3166c0f711c6a4f2b7fd64b75b7e3.poster.avif?t=1772689482\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363810/extras/91d3166c0f711c6a4f2b7fd64b75b7e3.webm?t=1772689482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363810/extras/91d3166c0f711c6a4f2b7fd64b75b7e3.mp4?t=1772689482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363810/extras/efdf3e065235f83fd8fbad822ed0a890.avif?t=1772689482\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 4 unique areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the order you explore: the Farmhouse, the Manor and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area has its own theme and original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the map come alive as you progress, as planes, trains and boats appear - the more you find, the more the village grows!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363810/extras/c4873547bb3f1fe07b95aaed6cd5b398.poster.avif?t=1772689482\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363810/extras/c4873547bb3f1fe07b95aaed6cd5b398.webm?t=1772689482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363810/extras/c4873547bb3f1fe07b95aaed6cd5b398.mp4?t=1772689482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align